ansform `FAQPage.tsx` into an interactive accordion and add rating buttons. Lastly, `Contact.tsx` will become an interactive form with validation, feedback, and location display. I also plan to add a button to clear filters.\n\n\n**Refining Checkout Experience**\n\nI\'m now diving into the checkout flow, beginning with enhancements to `Cart.tsx`. I\'m integrating discount coupon functionality and a progress bar for free shipping thresholds. I\'m ensuring all discount and order details transfer seamlessly to `Checkout.tsx`. Then I\'ll focus on crafting a streamlined checkout form for shipping, recipient details, and payment options. Finally, I\'m developing order tracking with a unique code, storing the order details, clearing the cart, and setting up redirection to the order history page.\n\n\n**Expanding Order Capabilities**\n\nI\'m now expanding the order management features. I will be incorporating a tracking code search filter, and adding an order cancellation simulation. I\'m also including a \"re-order\" button to streamline the checkout process. Furthermore, I\'ll start working on the review system, and customer support.\n\n\n"
